INT. DEEP-SEA RESEARCH HABITAT "THALASSA-9," MESS HALL - SHIP NIGHT

Low ceiling. Portholes show black water. A table bolted to the floor. Steam from five bowls of reconstituted soup.

Five crew eat in tired silence.

COMMANDER ILSE VARGA-OKONJO (50s, grey crewcut, flight jacket) cuts a biscuit in half.

DR. MBALI NKOSI-ARRINGTON (30s, marine biologist, spectacles on a string) stirs her soup without drinking.

ENGINEER DEWEY HOLLOWAY-SATO (40s, wrench in his belt) scrapes his bowl.

TECH PRIYANKA "PRIYA" DESAI-BRANDT (20s, tablet in one hand, spoon in the other) scrolls through readings.

And a quiet man, face smudged with grease, who has not given his name: A NEWCOMER (30s, orange vest, new boots).

ILSE
Anyone want to say anything?

Silence. A pipe knocks somewhere.

MBALI
The trench is warmer than yesterday.

DEWEY
Everything's warmer than yesterday.

PRIYA
Not everything. Pressure's flat.

NEWCOMER
Flat is good.

DEWEY
Flat is boring.

ILSE
I like boring.

PRIYA
I like flat.

MBALI
I like soup.

They eat. A porthole flickers: a pale shape drifts past and is gone.

MBALI (CONT'D)
Did anyone see that?

PRIYA
What?

DEWEY
Fish.

MBALI
It was larger than fish.

ILSE
Dr. Nkosi-Arrington, the instruments say nothing.

MBALI
The instruments aren't looking out the window.

NEWCOMER
It's the lights. They attract plankton.

DEWEY
Plankton doesn't look back.

PRIYA
Did it look back?

MBALI
I don't know.

The table goes quiet. Priya sets down her tablet, face up. Everyone leans in.

ILSE
Priya. Readings.

PRIYA
Nothing. A small thermal bloom, two hundred meters out.

DEWEY
Heat means life.

MBALI
Or a vent.

NEWCOMER
Or us.

Ilse looks at him. He looks at her. After a moment she nods and resumes cutting her biscuit.

ILSE
Eat. We have a shift in an hour.

They eat. Nobody speaks. The pipe knocks again.

Then the newcomer says, softly, to no one:

ARTHUR
Name's Arthur.

ILSE
Welcome, Arthur.

DEWEY
Welcome.

PRIYA
Welcome.

MBALI
Welcome. Your boots are very new.

ARTHUR
They're the only thing I own.

Mbali smiles for the first time. The others do too. Outside, the porthole darkens again.
